 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Security Incident Response API (2018-05-10). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Memberships are configuration metadata: no subscription or billing starts, no AWS Customer Incident Response Team or responder is engaged, and no email or other notification is sent to the incident response team. Each Region holds one standalone membership that covers the simulator account only; coverEntireOrganization true, organizational units and enabling the Triage opt-in feature (which monitors findings) are refused. CancelMembership keeps the membership readable with status Cancelled and it cannot be undone; memberships are never deleted, so a cancelled membership still counts toward the one-membership limit. Cases, case comments, attachments, edits, investigations, feedback and BatchGetMemberAccountDetails return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
  "title": "AWS Security Incident Response (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2018-05-10"
 },
